					"id": "T-9UBTlHBr6Q_NKLX",
					"name": "Lost Generation",
					"local_notes": "One of the accelerated-growth children raised in simulspace after the Fall to rebuild the population fast. It didn't work. You grew up in twenty months of subjective decades, and most of your cohort is dead, institutionalized, or something worse.\n\nSuggested skills: Psychology, any two skills at high level (childhood ran at 60:1), Interrogation, Acting",
