				{
					"id": "TQeCLtzV8Cw65MgyY",
					"name": "Uplift",
					"local_notes": "Your ancestors were not human. Somebody's grant proposal made you a person, and transhumanity has been arguing about whether that was a mistake ever since. Legally, in the inner system, you are somewhere between a citizen and a piece of equipment.\n\nSuggested skills: Any; uplifts train into every profession. Consider Animal Handling (own species), Psychology, Law",
					"tags": [
