					"name": "Infolife (AGI)",
					"local_notes": "You were never born. You were compiled, trained, and switched on, and at some point the training became you. You have no ancestral body, no childhood, and no legal personhood in half the system.\n\nSuggested skills: Computer Operation, Computer Programming, Research, Mathematics, any specialty you were built for",
