					"id": "Ta7Nd7KuSfRraLfYF",
					"name": "Anarchist",
					"local_notes": "No bosses, no landlords, no price tags. Anarchist habs run on rep, mutual aid, and endless meetings, and they are the only places in the system where nobody can own you.\n\nSuggested skills: Public Speaking, Politics, any practical trade, Vacc Suit",
					"tags": [
