								"Reputation",
								"Eclipse Phase"
							],
							"local_notes": "Anarchists, scum, Titanian mutualists, autonomists broadly. Counts across the entire autonomist alliance and most of the outer system. Maximum 8. Functions as Courtesy Rank for Pulling Rank requests (GURPS Social Engineering, Part VIII). 1-2 member in good standing, 3-4 known contributor, 5-6 respected fixture, 7-8 network celebrity - whose failures are equally famous.",
