					"id": "Tpw3H_TuIL-l2DupQ",
					"name": "Argonaut",
					"local_notes": "Open-source technoprogressives who think the answer to dangerous technology is more scientists watching it. Argonauts share everything, which makes them heroes to the outer system and a security problem to everyone else.\n\nSuggested skills: Research, any Science, Computer Programming, Teaching",
					"tags": [
