								"Social",
								"Reputation",
								"Eclipse Phase"
							],
							"local_notes": "Scientists, technologists, argonauts, open-source engineers. Counts at research stations, universities, anywhere data is shared. Maximum 8. Functions as Courtesy Rank for Pulling Rank requests (GURPS Social Engineering, Part VIII). 1-2 member in good standing, 3-4 known contributor, 5-6 respected fixture, 7-8 network celebrity - whose failures are equally famous.",
							"calc": {
