					"name": "Reclaimer",
					"local_notes": "Earth is not dead, it is occupied, and leaving it to the TITANs is a failure of nerve. Reclaimers run reconnaissance into the exclusion zone and lobby loudly for a return that most of the system considers suicidal.\n\nSuggested skills: Survival (Earth), Vacc Suit, Guns, Archaeology, Piloting",
